Q9. Update department of a specific student

db.Students.updateOne(
    { RollNo: 101 },
    {
        $set: {
            Department: "MCA"
        }
    }
)


 Q10. Update semester of all BCA students

db.Students.updateMany(
    { Department: "BCA" },
    {
        $set: {
            Semester: 6
        }
    }
)


 Q11. Replace an existing student document

